\ B-Sound Shim 01 — shimPulseSquash (ch04-shims.tex Def. 1A)
\ Book defaults: C4=261.63 Hz singing triad, 0.97f -> f scoop in 0.10 s
261.63 CONSTANT SQUASH-F0
0.10   CONSTANT SQUASH-SCOOP-T
: SHIM-PULSE-SQUASH ( t_local rho voice -- )
  >R
  SQUASH-F0 * HZ>Y
  SWAP DUP 0.0 >= SWAP SQUASH-SCOOP-T < AND IF
    \ 3% upward scoop (approx -0.044 oct -> 0)
    -0.044 +
  THEN
  R> PRIM-SINE ;
